{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Channel your 4 corners and start aiming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle squares is an online 8 directional 2D Shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your weapons, colored identity and embody the 4 corners!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tumble, Bounce, Recoil and FIGHT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each square can be equipped with 2 classes, each class focusing on individual play styles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choice of class is your choice of style(<i>skill</i>)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want power, AOE and pure, cold, calculated destruction? Grenade, Rocket Launcher! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">need speed, lust for despair and hunger for death? Charge, Shotgun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel like tumbling around is not enough? You want to fly?! Mini-gun, Revolver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think it's simply a skill issue? Prove it.. Revolver, Sniper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Know your taste for crumbling 4 cornered victims? Find a combination that suits you and show them by combining lots of other classes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now its up to you to become the dominating square among all squares!</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3180450?t=1731536122","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1731536122","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180450/a6b0c611223211b22e918eb6d7d524e21b544a25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1731536122","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180450/a6b0c611223211b22e918eb6d7d524e21b544a25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1731536122","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Channel your 4 corners and start aiming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle squares is an online 8 directional 2D Shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your weapons, colored identity and embody the 4 corners!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tumble, Bounce, Recoil and FIGHT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each square can be equipped with 2 classes, each class focusing on individual play styles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choice of class is your choice of style(<i>skill</i>)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want power, AOE and pure, cold, calculated destruction? Grenade, Rocket Launcher! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">need speed, lust for despair and hunger for death? Charge, Shotgun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel like tumbling around is not enough? You want to fly?! Mini-gun, Revolver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think it's simply a skill issue? Prove it.. Revolver, Sniper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Know your taste for crumbling 4 cornered victims? Find a combination that suits you and show them by combining lots of other classes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now its up to you to become the dominating square among all squares!</p>","developers":["Feesh Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180450/header.jpg?t=1731536122","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mov